/public/data/electrolux-professional/docs/

# Faz B — medya S3/CloudFront; git yalnızca katalog JSON + JS
/public/images/
/public/data/caglayan-market/
/public/data/prosogutma-market/
/public/data/vitrum-drawings/
/public/data/advanced-cuisine-clear-ice/

